{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>筲箕灣今日（27日）發生屍體發現案。下午2時19分，一名39歲姓林男在耀興道33號東駿苑住所內暈倒，其家人發現後報警求助。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至，林男現場被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，警方初步調查相信，死者在家中跌倒後失救致死。</p><figure><img alt=\"筲箕灣東駿苑一男住戶疑在家中跌倒，失救致死。（Google Maps截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1203107136016486400963027.jpeg/1Ousg5ZfJkylywcxCa--18ruVbPS2eaRuEyBQLhMgUA\"/><figcaption>筲箕灣東駿苑一男住戶疑在家中跌倒，失救致死。（Google Maps截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.088377+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:03:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:31.539422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:23.998995+00:00","content_hash":"8f2d432be982005034764e3223f6f42224f93939998b437288be4ebd0e19930b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}